Package: code-version-manager
Version: 0.2.2
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linxb <linxb@gzsendi.cn>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, git, openssh-client
Suggests: bcompare
Description: Graphical workspace version manager with optional remote Git sync
 A GTK desktop application for initializing version management in any folder,
 selecting packaged files, comparing complete snapshots with Beyond Compare,
 downloading historical versions, viewing generated RST changelogs, and
 synchronizing branches and version tags to remote Git repositories.
